<h1 id="submission-instructions">Submission Instructions</h1>

<ol>
  <li>The conference accepts submissions of papers and technical reports in Chinese or English, with a maximum length of 10 pages (including references).</li>
  <li>AIHT 2024 welcomes original, unpublished research papers that are not currently under review in any other forum. Papers should present novel theoretical insights, experimental results, or applications in the field.</li>
  <li>Submissions will undergo a stringent double-blind review process, adhering to the highest academic standards.</li>
</ol>

